// Test script to verify fixes for reported errors

// Setup
NE 1 5000.0000 5000.0000 0.0000 "Start"
STN 1
// BD <Pt> <Brg> <Quad> <Dist>
// Previous Error: Invalid Quadrant (1-4).
// Input was: BD (point) [bearing] [quadrant] [distance]
// Example: BD 2 45.0000 1 100.00
BD 2 45.0000 1 100.00 "Test BD"

// TRAV
TRAV ON
TRAV OFF

// Figure commands
// Previous: Figure BND started -> Unknown PNT -> Unknown XC -> Unknown MAPCHK
BEG BND
PNT 1
PNT 2
// XC tests (basic scaffold)
XC ZD (BULB) 100.0 45.00 50.0
PNT 2_XC_0
END
MAPCHK BND
